
<div class="carousel">
        <h1>Posters</h1>
        <div class="carousel_inner">
            <div class="carousel_item carousel_item__active">
                <div class="carousel_item_container">
                    <img src="img/aaip.png" alt="Slide 1">
                <div>
                    <h2>An American <br>In Paris</h2>
                    <p>This poster was made for a hypocritical 
                        symphony show of the song An American in 
                        Paris by George Gershwin. The song was 
                        based on Gershwin's time visiting Paris 
                        during the Annees Folles, the Roaring 
                        20’s as we call it in the States. I wanted 
                        to capture the fantastical nature of 
                        that time as well as what Paris would 
                        be like to an American. </p>
                </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="carousel_item">
                <div class="carousel_item_container">
                    <img src="img/iconicchair.png" alt="Slide 1">
                <div>
                    <h2>Iconic Chair</h2>
                    <p>This poster was made for my Design I 
                        class final. I was given the Zigzag 
                        chair which was designed by Gerrit 
                        Rietveld. Rietveld was part of the 
                        De Stijl movement which was a major 
                        inspiration for the poster. Using 
                        their principles of abstraction of 
                        form and color I complimented the 
                        simplicity of the zigzag chair. This 
                        simplicity and easy assembly was 
                        one of the main principles Rietveld 
                        focused on when designing his furniture.  </p>
                </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button class="carousel_button carousel_button__prev">
            <img src="img/prev.svg" alt="">
        </button>
        <button class="carousel_button carousel_button__next">
            <img src="img/next.svg" alt="">
        </button>
        <div class="carousel_indicators">
            <span class="carousel_dot carousel_dot__active"></span>
            <span class="carousel_dot"></span>
        </div>
    </div>

